{"title":"Raw Rabbit","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Rabbit</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"wp-quest\"><b>Quest item.</b> Asked for by Something for the Pot.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rabbit\" title=\"Rabbit - dropped it in 11 of 21 looted corpses (1/1.9)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/55badb7f02a5a3b9a2bc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rabbit</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.9<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"raw-rabbit\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/cooking\">Cooking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/cooked-rabbit\">Cooked Rabbit</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Cooking 1</span></li></ul>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/f8a0489eef21034d4ee1.svg\" alt=\"Raw Rabbit\"></div><h3>Raw Rabbit</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>1 monster</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Used in</th><td>1 recipe</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/14/2026, 10:41:17 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}